{"_id":"681a18c8ca58dc6c5afba539","title":"Jujutsu Shenanigans Super Tze Moveset (Recoded Fly Movement)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Jujutsu-Shenanigans-Super-Tze-Moveset-38861","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":60494,"executes":607,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e6ee29be773811767b6f377c7762351291215fdb5137efdda2a699ede2496ed4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1746540744547.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1746540744547.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e6ee29be773811767b6f377c7762351291215fdb5137efdda2a699ede2496ed4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1746540744547.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1746540744547.png"},"likeCount":16,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2025-05-06T14:12:24.599Z","updatedAt":"2025-05-06T14:12:24.599Z","lastBump":"2025-05-06T14:12:24.599Z","script":"-- (  TIP : TO ROTATE WHILE FLYING ENABLE SHIFT LOCK. )\ngetgenv().LockOnHitboxSize = 128 -- ( Lock On Hitbox Size ( in Vector3 scaling ) )\ngetgenv().M1ChargeSize = 128 -- ( Size for the m1 zoom to size ( in Vector3 scaling ) + ( recommend to not go above 128. ) )\ngetgenv().ButtonToGoSuper = true -- ( Makes it so you only go super after u press a button in the settings menu )\ngetgenv().M1OnlyChargeAtLockedOn = true -- ( makes it so it only charges at the person you're locking onto (still needs to be in hitbox distance ! !) )\n-- ( SKILL NAMES [ CHANGEABLE ] )\ngetgenv()[\"Lightning Beatdown\"] = \"Lightning Beatdown\"\ngetgenv()[\"Electric Orb\"] = \"Electric Orb\"\n-- ( PC CONTROLS [ CHANGEABLE + DEFAULT ONES ARE OFFICIAL ONES ] )\ngetgenv().ToggleFly = \"e\" -- must be lower case while rest need to be CAPITAL\ngetgenv().Boost = \"Q\"\ngetgenv().ToggleLockOn = \"R\"\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://rawscripts.net/raw/Jujutsu-Shenanigans-Super-Tze-Moveset-Fixed-fly-on-mobile-devices-39532\"))()","features":"[ UPDATE LOGS ]\n• ADDED MOBILE SUPPORT\n\n• THE SCRIPT IS NO LONGER USING GISTHUB, AS THE GISTHUB ACCOUNT GOT BANNED ( idk why i dont read the gisthub rules)\n\nScript Features :\n\nfirst skill : Lightning Beatdown\nLightning Beatdown is an skill version of the Super Tze M1 spam.\n\nsecond skill: Super Orb\nSuper Orb is the Super Tze moveset orb lightning strike move\n\nPrimary Features :\nFly\nBoost\nLock On\nSettings Area Toggle\nOfficial Animations\nClient Sided Visual Effects and Sound Effects (movement and anims are FE)\nNo Key","tags":["jjs","Shenanigans","Super","Tze","Moveset"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","username":"DeathPort","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b579be733584343daeb65e9ebc6e8c673ab8515eb92800d200bea683ae63841e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67af269724d76538a5a97323-1767021867316.png"},"status":"offline","id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b579be733584343daeb65e9ebc6e8c673ab8515eb92800d200bea683ae63841e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67af269724d76538a5a97323-1767021867316.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:54:49.881Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"681a18c8ca58dc6c5afba53b","editBy":{"_id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323","username":"DeathPort","status":"offline","id":"67af269724d76538a5a97323"},"messa